esn't properly handle `npx skills` commands - they return empty output silently.\r\n40: \r\n41: ```bash\r\n42: # ❌ This returns no\n<truncated 669 bytes>\n the file at:\r\n68:    ```\r\n69:    C:\\Users\\<YourUsername>\\.agents\\skills\\find-skills\\SKILL.md\r\n70:    ```\r\n71: \r\n72: ### Step 3: Restart Claude Code\r\n73: \r\n74: Close and reopen Claude Code.\r\n75: \r\n76: ### Step 4: Verify\r\n77: \r\n78: Say to Claude Code: \"find a skill for data analysis\"\r\n79: \r\n80: If you see search results, installation is successful.\r\n81: \r\n82: ## Files\r\n83: \r\n84: ```\r\n85: findskill/\r\n86: ├── README.md           # English documentation (this file)\r\n87: ├── README_CN.md        # Chinese documentation\r\n88: ├── LICENSE             # MIT License\r\n89: ├── original/\r\n90: │   └── SKILL.md        # Original version from vercel-labs\r\n91: └── windows/\r\n92:     └── SKILL.md        # Windows-compatible version\r\n93: ```\r\n94: \r\n95: ## Key Changes\r\n96: \r\n97: 1. **Added Windows compatibility warning** at the top\r\n98: 2. **Changed all commands** to use `powershell -Command \"...\"` format\r\n99: 3. **Added Chinese to English keyword reference** (search only supports English)\r\n100: 4. **Added troubleshooting section**\r\n101: \r\n102: ## Usage\r\n103: \r\n104: After installation, ask Claude Code:\r\n105: \r\n106: - \"find a skill for react\"\r\n107: - \"is there a skill for code review\"\r\n108: - \"search skill for data analysis\"\r\n109: \r\n110: Claude Code will now correctly use PowerShell to run the search.\r\n111: \r\n112: ## Known Limitations\r\n113: \r\n114: 1. **Search only supports English keywords** - Chinese queries need to be translated by AI\r\n115: 2. **Trigger is semantic** - AI may or may not trigger find-skills depending on how you phrase it. Adding \"skill\" to your request makes it more reliable.\r\n116: 3. **Windows only** - macOS/Linux users should use the original version\r\n117: \r\n118: ## Credits\r\n119: \r\n120: - Original skill: [vercel-labs/skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills)\r\n121: - Windows fix: [@KimYx0207](https://github.com/KimYx0207)\r\n122: \r\n123: ## License\r\n124: \r\n125: MIT (same as original)\r\n126: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
